<h4><span class="mw-headline" id="2.4GHz_receiver">2.4GHz receiver</span></h4>
<p>2.4GHz RF signal receiver down into quadrature baseband signal, with two high-resolution, high-speed ADC and the latter into a digital signal. In order to accommodate different signal channels, a radio receiver integrated RF filters, automatic gain control (AGC), DC offset compensation circuit and a baseband filter.
