Include: 
</p>
<ul><li>inductor</li>
<li>varactor</li>
<li>closed-loop filter</li></ul>
<p>Clock generator contains a built-in calibration circuit and self-test circuitry. Clock phase and quadrature phase noise through the optimal calibration algorithm processing patent on the chip, in order to ensure that the receiver and transmitter to achieve the best performance.
